Bjarni,

If you are using landmark shape data, there is an argument in gpagen for this: ‘ProcD = TRUE’. As part of the output list, a matrix of Procrustes (Euclidean) distances will be produced.

Otherwise try: as.matrix(dist(two.d.array(myshapedata)))

