Russell,

One of the arguments for plotRefToTarget is “gridPars”, which has link to the function, gridPar; i.e., grid parameters.  You can also find details here: https://rdrr.io/cran/geomorph/man/gridPar.html

You can change any of the plotting parameters with gridPar, by making an object that defines the parameters you want, used in plotRefToTarget.  There are several examples in the gridPar help page to show how this works.

Mike

